# Design system

Inspired by Linear: dense, quiet, calm, keyboard-first. Content leads; chrome stays out of the way.
Inspiration only. Do not copy Linear's branding or assets.
Tokens live in `src/index.css` (Tailwind v4 `@theme`). Enum labels live in `src/lib/labels.ts`.
Enforced by `npm run lint:design` and `src/copyBudget.test.tsx`. Both run in CI.

## Principles

1. Content over chrome. Data is the loudest thing on screen. Borders, backgrounds and labels whisper.
2. Say it once, in as few words as possible. If a label, icon or position already explains it, add no sentence.
3. Color means status, nothing else. Everything else is neutral gray.
4. Density with rhythm. Small type, tight rows, 4px spacing. Hierarchy comes from weight and gray level, not size.
5. Progressive disclosure. Show the answer. Details, source text and internals live one click (or hover) away.

## Tokens (only these values are allowed)

- Font: Inter (`cv11`, `ss01`), `tabular-nums` for every number, date and ID column.
  Monospace (JetBrains Mono, 12px) only for IDs such as MRN and order number.
- Type scale (use the named utilities; the default Tailwind scale is removed):

  | Utility        | Size / line height | Weight | Use                         |
  | -------------- | ------------------ | ------ | --------------------------- |
  | `text-caption` | 12 / 16            | 400    | Captions and meta           |
  | `text-body`    | 13 / 20            | 400    | Body and table default      |
  | `text-emph`    | 14 / 20            | 500    | Emphasis                    |
  | `text-section` | 16 / 24            | 600    | Section title               |
  | `text-title`   | 20 / 28            | 600    | Page title (one per page)   |

  Weights: 400, 500, 600 only. Never 700+. Never text larger than 20px.
- Text color, three levels only: `text-fg` (zinc-900 / dark zinc-100), `text-fg-2` (zinc-500), `text-fg-3` (zinc-400).
- Surfaces: `bg-app` (#FBFBFC), `bg-panel` (white), `bg-sidebar` (zinc-50). Hairlines are `border-line`
  (zinc-200/60). No shadows except `shadow-sm` on popovers and menus.
- Accent: one indigo (indigo-600) for the primary button, focus rings, the selected nav item and links.
  At most one primary button (`variant="default"`) per view.
- Status (6px dot plus gray label). Labels stay zinc-700. Only the dot is colored.

  | Dot          | Statuses                                  |
  | ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |
  | green-500    | Ready, Approved                           |
  | amber-500    | Hold, Needs documents                     |
  | red-500      | Blocked, Denied, Unreadable               |
  | violet-500   | Nurse review                              |
  | zinc-400     | Closed, Unassigned, Automated, Submitted  |

- Spacing: 4px grid, Tailwind 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8 (no half steps). Page padding 24px (`p-6`).
  Section gap 24px. Card padding 12 to 16px.
- Radius: 6px controls and chips (`rounded-md`), 8px cards and panels (`rounded-lg`).
  Nothing pill-shaped except avatars and status dots.
- Sizes: table rows 36px, list items 32px, inputs and buttons 28px (32px for the primary button).
  Icons 14px in tables, 16px elsewhere, Lucide only, stroke 1.5.

## Copy rules

- Page header is the title only, optionally with a count in secondary gray ("Worklist 9").
  No subtitles or paragraphs under titles. Explanations go in a `?` tooltip or the docs.
- Labels: at most 3 words, sentence case, no trailing colons on table headers.
- Helper text only where an action is irreversible: one line, at most 12 words.
- Never show internal identifiers (snake_case, fact keys, enum values like `patient_reported`).
  Map every enum to a human label in `src/lib/labels.ts`. Raw keys only behind an "Advanced" or dev toggle.
- Dates: tables `Wed 11/18 · 2:30 PM`. Relative where it matters (`in 2d`, `3h ago`). Absolute ISO only in tooltips.
- Numbers and rules read as short facts: `≥ 6 wks`, `40 / 42 days`. Not sentences.
- The AI summary is at most 2 sentences and 40 words. Engine reason sentences show on expand, not by default.
- Banners: at most one per page, only for things that block the user's work.
  Read-only is a lock icon next to the title, never a banner.

## Components

Shared building blocks live in `src/components/ui/`: StatusDot, PropertyList, CitationChip, SourceTag,
CollapsibleSection, DataTable, FlagIcons, Kbd, plus shadcn-style primitives (Button, Tooltip, Popover, Avatar, Tabs).
Do not introduce another component library or one-off styles.

- Tables: no zebra, no vertical borders, hairline row dividers, hover `bg-hover`, left-align text,
  right-align numbers, at most 8 columns (the rest goes in a tooltip or detail view).
  Selected row: 2px indigo left border plus `bg-hover`.
- Chips and tags: neutral only (`bg-chip text-chip-fg`, 12px). At most 2 visible per row, then `+N` with a tooltip.
  Never a colored chip for something that is not a status.
- Flags column: at most 2 icons per row, ordered by severity, each with a tooltip. No legend button.
- Filters: one compact toolbar row. Search, then filter buttons that open popovers. Applied filters are removable
  neutral chips. No row of KPI pills. Counts belong in the view tabs.
- Tabs: text tabs, counts in secondary gray, underline on the active one. Each tab is a saved filter.
- Detail panes: label/value property lists, two columns, label 12px secondary, value 13px.
  Collapsible sections use a 13px/500 header with a chevron and count ("Rules checked 4/4").
- Empty, loading and error states: one line of gray text plus at most one action. Skeleton rows, not spinners.
- Keyboard: J/K move between rows, Enter opens, Esc closes or goes back, Cmd-K opens the command palette,
  A assigns to me, `/` focuses search. Show shortcut hints in tooltips.
- Motion: 120 to 160ms ease-out on hover, expand and panel open only. No bounces, no page transitions.
- Dark mode: supported from tokens. Never hard-code colors in components.

## Forbidden (the linter fails on these)

hex/rgb colors outside `src/index.css`; `text-xs`/`text-sm`/`text-lg` and up; `font-bold` and heavier;
`shadow-md` and up; arbitrary values like `p-[13px]`; half-step spacing like `px-2.5`;
`rounded-full` outside avatar and status dot; snake_case in JSX text or props;
more than one `variant="default"` Button per page file.

## Visual review loop

After building or changing any screen: `npm run screenshots` (Playwright, 1440x900, light and dark, into
`/screenshots`), review against this checklist, and list violations and fixes before reporting the stage done.

- [ ] One clear primary action
- [ ] Nothing larger than 20px
- [ ] No explanatory paragraphs
- [ ] Color only on status
- [ ] At most 2 chips per row
- [ ] No internal keys
- [ ] Numbers tabular and aligned
- [ ] Consistent 4px rhythm
- [ ] Would a Linear designer delete anything here? If yes, delete it.
